  "details": "If you sign in on one account that has notifications that are unread, then sign out of that account. Without closing the tab, you sign back into a different account and you should see the previous accounts notifications.\n\nSteps:\n\n- Sign in to one account\n\n- Make sure it has notifications\n\n- Sign out\n\n- Sign in to a second account\n\n- See notifications and it should have the first accounts notifications there.\n\nEdit: Picture includes shows red and blue marked areas. Red is current account, blue is previous account. Green can see both previous accounts\n\nAll of these are cleared on tab close/refresh",
